<Simple title="Contact" seoTitle="Contact Best Cities in Spain" description="How to reach Best Cities in Spain: corrections, questions about Spanish cities, and what we can't help with (tour and hotel bookings)." path="/contact/">
  <p class="lede">Write to <a href="mailto:hello@bestcitiesinspain.com">hello@bestcitiesinspain.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>What to write about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> a timetable, price or opening time that has changed. Tell us the page and your source, and we'll check it.</li>
    <li><strong>Questions</strong> about visiting Spain's cities that our guides don't answer.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Tour bookings:</strong> tours are sold by GetYourGuide. Use the contact details in your booking confirmation.</li>
    <li><strong>Hotel bookings:</strong> stays are booked with Booking.com or the hotel. Contact them directly.</li>
    <li><strong>Paid listings:</strong> no winery, hotel or tour operator pays to be listed.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We're an independent guide, not a tourist office. See <a href="/about/">about this guide</a>.</p>
</Simple>
